# Requirements

  * Python 3.7
  * Numpy
  * Pandas
  * Backtesting

# Instructions

    - run.py should intall all nessisary programes and intiate test.py
    - In test.py you can imput your chosen strategy which will be backtested against the generated data.
    - A graph will be generated when finished.

# Best Pratices

    - Use a virtual machine
    - Run under 5,000,000 ticks for optimal preformance

# Future Updates

    - Use of tensor math to better otimize preformance and allow for more tick generation.
    